flowchart LR
    UCI[Official UCI Cleveland data] --> CLEAN[Clean schema and map target]
    CLEAN --> EDA[EDA figures]
    CLEAN --> SPLIT[Stratified 80/20 split]
    SPLIT --> CV[Training-only 5-fold CV]
    CV --> PREP[Impute scale and one-hot encode inside folds]
    PREP --> LR[Logistic Regression]
    PREP --> RF[Random Forest]
    LR --> TRACK[MLflow params metrics models and plots]
    RF --> TRACK
    TRACK --> PICK[Select by mean CV ROC-AUC]
    PICK --> HOLDOUT[Evaluate winner on untouched holdout]
    HOLDOUT --> MODEL[Serialized full pipeline]
    MODEL --> API[FastAPI JSON predictions]
    API --> IMAGE[Non-root Docker image]
    IMAGE --> K8S[Kubernetes 2 replicas and LoadBalancer]
    API --> METRICS[Structured logs and Prometheus metrics]
    METRICS --> GRAFANA[Grafana dashboard]
    CI[GitHub Actions lint tests train and Docker check] --> MODEL
